# This recipe reads credentials from the nearest .env, walking up from this
# folder -- by default that's agents-cookbook/.env at the cookbook root, so
# one paste there covers every recipe. Copy this file to a local .env in
# THIS folder only if you want to override the shared config for this
# recipe specifically.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Fallback for the errors-as-observations demo (deliberately Haiku -- testing
# a fast/cheap model's error-recovery behavior is the point). The tool-surface
# comparison hardcodes claude-sonnet-5 in code, because writing correct
# filtering code for the code-execution surface needs more than Haiku-tier
# reasoning -- see the recipe README.
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5
